Once you arrive in the dungeon, copy everything between these two quote 
marks, but not the quote marks themselves, then paste it into your 
terminal.  In Putty, this last step can be done with a simple right click.

"Oacefmnop cfmnoprs acfghij  0
spiders
rb/(
uabdghijk "

